OL,3,GNEWSAStroke victim reunited with man
OL,4,Awho saved his life
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who suffered a stroke while on a
OL,7,Fsolo motorbike ride in the Yorkshire
OL,8,FDales has been reunited with the
OL,9,Fstranger who saved his life.
OL,11,FEarl Parker, 80, was in Swaledale on 7
OL,12,FApril when he was suddenly hit by
OL,13,Fintense pain and loss of feeling in his
OL,14,Fhand, which he said "hit me like a
OL,15,Fhammer".
OL,17,FAshley Hird, 56, a passing farmer to
OL,18,Fwhom Earl had just been chatting,
OL,19,Frecognised his symptoms as a stroke and
OL,20,Ftook him to a GP surgery in Hawes as he
OL,21,F"knew I had to do something".
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
