OL,3,GNEWSAStroke victim reunited with man
OL,4,Awho saved his life
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarl was airlifted to hospital where he
OL,7,Fwas treated and recovered within days,
OL,8,Fand, meeting Ashley again months later,
OL,9,Fhe said he wanted to "raise more
OL,10,Fawareness about strokes" due to the
OL,11,Fexperience and the help he received.
